    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "NNP at factor cost is officially designated as National Income.",
        "Consumer Price Index (CPI) measures retail inflation and is used by the RBI for inflation targeting.",
        "The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) was established in 1935 and nationalised in 1949.",
        "Goods and Services Tax (GST) is a destination-based tax implemented on 1 July 2017.",
        "Human Development Index (HDI) is published by UNDP based on health, education, and income indicators."
      ],
      "id": "c8qqtfm"
    },
